# --- Vault-leak guards (added for conboy.dev) ---
# Nothing from an Obsidian vault should ever be committed except what is
# deliberately copied into content/. These are belt-and-braces.
.obsidian/
.trash/
private/
**/private/
*.confidential.md
*.private.md
# Never commit a vault that was symlinked or copied in wholesale
content/.obsidian/
content/**/.obsidian/
